Except that Nethack is a much more complex system than what you likely
created.

For Nethack to ensure keys are always available to open any doors,
you'd have to patch into the complicated level creation code.  You'd
have to account for the many ways players can get outside the expected
level areas, including obvious means (teleport, level teleport,
polymorph into Xorns and trapdoors) and less obvious ones (the paths
dug by guards in letting players escape from vaults).

There is no easy way to ensure players will always be able to get
enough keys to open all doors without cutting back on those features,
which would make it a substantially different game.

